            <title>5.104</title>
            <pubDate>Tue, 06 Oct 2026 17:01:36 +0000</pubDate>
            <sparkle:version>582</sparkle:version>
            <sparkle:shortVersionString>5.104</sparkle:shortVersionString>
            <sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>14.0</sparkle:minimumSystemVersion>
            <description><![CDATA[<h2 style="font:600 15px -apple-system;margin:0 0 6px">Promptr Studio Pro 5.104</h2>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:0 0 4px">Prompt editor</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li><b>Highlighting by meaning.</b> Whole phrases take the color of what they describe: camera, movement, character, wardrobe, scene, light, look and sound. Comments stay gray, structure has its own color, and the text you are typing stays white until you pause. Hover a phrase to see its group.</li>
<li><b>Reference your references.</b> Type @ to pick a reference from the composer, for example @Image 2, or one of your locked characters. Hover a marker to see its thumbnail. Markers follow their file when you reorder or remove references, and every model receives them in its own format.</li>
</ul>
<p style="font:600 13px -apple-system;margin:8px 0 4px">Fixes</p>
<ul style="font:13px -apple-system;margin:0;padding-left:18px">
<li>Format no longer wraps the prompt in &lt;PROMPT&gt; tags.</li>
</ul>
]]></description>
